#-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
#    Name			: PLZERO.scr
#    Description     		: This script is execute through batch job for FX zeroisation
#    Date            		: 20-12-2014
#    Author          		: Suhasini
#    Input           		: NA
#    Output			: NA
#    Called Script	 	: NA
#    Calling Script	 	: NA
#    Menu Option		: HBJSTM, HBJE
